# shell: desktop
# home: fixture
# prefs: factory
# What a first run looks like: this Desktop belongs to a device, so the
# machine's own storage is not poured onto it, and the Deskbar lists
# this shell rather than every process the machine happens to run.
wait 20
expect-no-desk-icon Disks
note the Deskbar knows this shell and nothing it did not start
note the global bar is on, so the leaf sits below it
click 980 40
wait 4
expect-menu Applications
key Escape
wait 4
note and the places a person drops things into are already there
expect-file /tmp/trk_home/Desktop
expect-file /tmp/trk_home/.config/tracker/icons
